@startuml
actor KafkaBroker
participant "DeviceConsumer" as DC  #lightblue
participant "SchemaRegistry" as AVRO
participant "DeviceEventConsumer" as DC  #lightblue
participant "DeviceService" as DS  #lightblue
participant "DeviceRepository" as REPO  #lightblue
participant "Postgres" as DB

KafkaBroker --> DC : события в Avro (DeviceEvents)
DC -> AVRO : десериализация Avro
AVRO -> DC : DeviceEvents
DC -> DS : DeviceEvents

DS -> REPO : сохранить
REPO -> DB : сохранить

@enduml
